3. applyDesignDiff() - applies diff to raw design
4. flattenDesign() again - converts result back for display
    ↓
Returns { dragDiff, output }
    ↓
dragDiff is passed to AlgorithmApp as designDiff prop
    ↓
ComposeDiagram receives designDiff
    ↓
buildDiagramSnapshot() calls:
    designWithDiff(design, designDiff)
        ↓
        Adds "compose.diffStatus" attributes to each piece/connection:
        - "removed" (in diff.pieces.removed / diff.connections.removed)
        - "modified" (in diff.pieces.updated / diff.connections.updated)
        - "added" (in diff.pieces.added / diff.connections.added)
        - "unchanged" (in base that aren't in any diff category)
    ↓
getDiffStatusFromAttributes() reads these attributes
    ↓
getEntityStatusColor() maps to CSS colors:
    - removed → red (#ef4444)
    - added → green (#22c55e)
    - modified → orange (#f59e0b)
    - default → foreground color
    ↓
Pieces & connections rendered with colored SVG circles/lines
```

